## NOTE: FreeSWITCH reads this file with grep: a line with a single # is a DISABLED MODULE, only ## is a comment, and nothing may follow a module name on its line.
## Mission Voice MVC module set (MV-FS-002). Everything not listed is not built.
## Rationale per line; see blackbox/README.md. Changes go through the decision register.
## fs_cli / ESL commands used by the controller
applications/mod_commands
## answer, bridge, set, sleep, playback: the dialplan primitives
applications/mod_dptools
## G1 interim only: gateway legs and the S1 team conference; removed when the relay lands (D97, P33)
applications/mod_conference
## the one voice codec (D81 intelligibility; PTT 20 ms frames)
codecs/mod_opus
## core database in PostgreSQL so registrations are shared across the hot pair (D95)
databases/mod_pgsql
## dialplan supplied by the controller through mod_xml_curl
dialplans/mod_dialplan_xml
## SIP over TLS 1.3, SRTP; the only endpoint module
endpoints/mod_sofia
## ESL, loopback only (F7)
event_handlers/mod_event_socket
## ring-back / busy tones generated locally; no audio files shipped
formats/mod_tone_stream
loggers/mod_console
## production level excludes SDP (F8)
loggers/mod_logfile
## directory and dialplan lookups to the controller over loopback
xml_int/mod_xml_curl
#
## Deliberately absent (D46 no beacons; attack surface; not needed):
##   applications/mod_signalwire   connects to SignalWire's cloud: forbidden
##   applications/mod_enum         DNS lookups outward
##   applications/mod_httapi       outbound HTTP
##   applications/mod_voicemail, mod_fifo, mod_valet_parking, mod_sms, mod_esf, mod_fsv, mod_hash, mod_db, mod_expr, mod_test
##   applications/mod_av, mod_spandsp   video and fax
##   codecs/mod_g723_1, mod_g729, mod_amr, mod_b64   not in the codec profile
##   endpoints/mod_verto, mod_skinny, mod_rtc, mod_loopback
##   event_handlers/mod_cdr_csv, mod_cdr_sqlite; xml_int/mod_xml_cdr   the controller's audit is the record (section 4 of the E2EE analysis)
##   xml_int/mod_xml_rpc, mod_xml_scgi   second administrative surfaces
##   languages/mod_lua             no scripting in the core
##   formats/mod_sndfile, mod_native_file, mod_local_stream, mod_png
##   say/mod_say_en
